{"seq":45,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0143"},"reason":"The notes now name the evidence behind the dispute: an ancient-DNA study (Librado et al., Nature 2021) found that the tarpan does not descend from the same population as modern domestic horses.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC8550961/"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",24],["-","disputed;"],["+","disputed:"],["=",1],["+","an ancient-DNA study (Librado et al., Nature 2021) found that "],["=",2],["+","tarpan does not descend from the same population as modern domestic horses. The "],["=",9]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",20],["-","umstritten;"],["+","umstritten:"],["=",1],["+","Eine Studie mit alter DNA (Librado u. a., Nature 2021) ergab, dass der Tarpan nicht von derselben Population abstammt wie "],["=",2],["+","heutigen Hauspferde. Die "],["=",9]]},{"field":"notesRu","old":"Был ли тарпан диким предком домашней лошади, спорно; карточка ожидает ответ «тарпан».","new":"Был ли тарпан диким предком домашней лошади, спорно: исследование древней ДНК (Librado и др., Nature, 2021) показало, что тарпан происходит не от той же популяции, что современные домашние лошади. Карточка ожидает ответ «тарпан»."}],"hash":"4fc1672e6b08","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"d7d47d0f069837ac78f56153cf14a39b5e87ebd882e52c867c16ce275d7218e9"},
